    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">būlīmus</span></b> , i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούλιμος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>great hunger</i>, <i>bulimy;</i> hence also, <i>weakness of
				the stomach</i>, <i>fainting</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 16,
				3, 9</span></i>; cf. bu; <i><span class="en">Veg. 5, 34</span></i>
			(3, 35); 5, 37 (3, 38) (in <i><span class="en">Varr. 2, 5, 4</span></i>, written as
			Greek).—Also written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">būlī-ma</span></b> , ae,
			f., Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 32</span></i> Müll.</div>
